{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669370/extras/131177df4d8c9d1397fc4a11a2df18d8.poster.avif?t=1753726473\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669370/extras/131177df4d8c9d1397fc4a11a2df18d8.webm?t=1753726473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669370/extras/131177df4d8c9d1397fc4a11a2df18d8.mp4?t=1753726473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Defend your armored rig from endless waves of ruthless raiders in the intense roguelike survival driller, Dead Oil. Between brutal attacks, drill deep into the scorched earth of a post-apocalyptic wasteland to extract oil and salvage valuable resources. Choose your upgrades carefully to reinforce your rig, improve your drilling capabilities, and ensure your survival. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669370/extras/7e2123544346d84bd7fc37b5cb6d7131.avif?t=1753726473\" /></div>Dig deep beneath your rig to find hidden caches of oil and rare metals essential for upgrading your defenses. Keep your eyes on the clock, you must return and prepare for the next fierce attack. How much oil can you find before danger arrives?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669370/extras/4b879ce0f86476c46b8b784057242e93.poster.avif?t=1753726473\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669370/extras/4b879ce0f86476c46b8b784057242e93.webm?t=1753726473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669370/extras/4b879ce0f86476c46b8b784057242e93.mp4?t=1753726473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669370/extras/c91e488b5dab3b26fe077b108d01be3e.avif?t=1753726473\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take command of your rig\u2019s powerful defenses and fight off raiders that attack from every direction. From swift melee attackers to armored vehicles and artillery strikes, prioritize your targets or watch your rig crumble to pieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669370/extras/Fight_1.gif?t=1753726473\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669370/extras/74d4a90d11e9be49dd2f6df16e523d5f.avif?t=1753726473\" /></div>Turn scavenged scrap and oil into formidable upgrades: enhance your weapons, reinforce armor plating, accelerate your drilling speed, and upgrade your radar to detect valuable resources faster. Every choice you make increases your chances of surviving Dead Oil.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669370/extras/Upgrade_1.gif?t=1753726473\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3669370?t=1753726473","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3669370?t=1753726473","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669370/221b59e2a72a401fff16850f268db83bf0fdfe06/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753726473","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_i